<title>UK: Lloyds TSB shares up after analysts meet.</title>
<headline>Lloyds TSB shares up after analysts meet.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Lloyds TSB Group Plc were 15p higher at 518-1/2p in afternoon trade Monday after analysts met the company and some decided to increase their 1997 pretax profit estimates.</p>
<p>Folowing the meeting which analysts described as &quot;positive&quot; and &quot;impressive&quot;, analysts were grouping around the 3.0 billion stg mark for the bank's 1997 profit and some were also raising earnings per share and dividend forecasts.</p>
</text>
